  <regions type="content">
    <region left="0" top="9" width="665" height="53" border="true" color="#000000" fontSize="30">
      <text lang="eng" width="662" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 30px;">EUROCODE 2 (Concrete structures)</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="666" top="9" width="459" height="46" border="true" color="#000000" fontSize="20">
      <text lang="eng" width="459" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 20px; font-family: Arial Black;">for educational purposes only</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="63" width="249" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="16">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">The equivalent ‘stresses’</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="90" width="372" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">σ.equivalent</e>
          <e type="operand">0.44</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ck</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">ρ</e>
          <e type="operand">100</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operand">0.67</e>
          <e type="operand">f.yk</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">0.44</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ck</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="144" width="226" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="16">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">Tension reinforcement</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="171" width="163" height="46" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">A.s</e>
          <e type="operand">M</e>
          <e type="operand">0.87</e>
          <e type="operand">f.yk</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">0.8</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="225" width="276" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="16" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">Compression reinforcement</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="252" width="372" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="372" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>If, for a rectangular section, M &gt; 0.167 fck bd2, compression reinforcement is required</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="288" width="198" height="61" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">A.s'</e>
          <e type="operand">M</e>
          <e type="operand">0.167</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ck</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">b</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operand">0.87</e>
          <e type="operand">f.yk</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operand">d'</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="369" width="166" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>d' the depth to its centroid</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="387" width="250" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>A's  is the area of the compression steel</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="414" width="363" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="351" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>If, for flanged sections, M &gt; 0.567fck bf hf (d– 0.5hf ) the section should be redesigned. bf and hf are the width and the thickness of the flange. hf should not be taken as more than 0.36d.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="486" width="185" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="16">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-size: 16px;">Bar arrangements</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="522" width="79" height="26" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operand">n</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operand">8</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="549" width="52" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">slabs</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="63" top="549" width="171" height="31" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">150</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">s.Bar</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operand">300</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="576" width="155" height="31" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">10</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">ϕ.Bar</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operand">20</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="630" width="474" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>the maximum design moment that can be transferred by a strip to a column is:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="657" width="182" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">M.max</e>
          <e type="operand">0.167</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ck</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">b.e</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="702" width="279" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>To avoid compression reinforcement in slabs</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="729" width="152" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">M.u</e>
          <e type="operand">K.lim</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ck</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">b</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="774" width="97" height="29" border="true" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">M.applied</e>
          <e type="operand">M.u</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="108" top="774" width="149" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>then it is good moment</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="810" width="130" height="46" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">A.s</e>
          <e type="operand">M</e>
          <e type="operand">0.87</e>
          <e type="operand">f.yk</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">z</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="855" width="342" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>z &amp; K are obtained from the tables but it all other cases:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="873" width="112" height="55" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">K</e>
          <e type="operand">M</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ck</e>
          <e type="operand">b</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="927" width="167" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>follow the followong rules:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="945" width="251" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>1 - provide top and bottom reinforcemen</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="972" width="338" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>2 - in each layer provide bars parallel to the slab edges</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="999" width="533" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>3 - in each of the four layers the area of reinforcement per unit length should be equal to<br />75% of the reinforcement required for the maximum span moment per unit length</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="9" top="1044" width="528" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>4 - the area of reinforcement in (c) can be halved if one edge of the slab in the corner is<br />continuous.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1089" width="463" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>In flat slabs, shear stresses at the column perimeter should be checked first:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1125" width="137" height="51" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd.p</e>
          <e type="operand">1000</e>
          <e type="operand">V.eff</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">u.c</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="162" top="1143" width="130" height="31" border="true" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd.p</e>
          <e type="operand">0.9</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ck</e>
          <e type="function" args="1">sqrt</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">≤</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="306" top="1143" width="254" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10" isBreakable="false">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>where uc is the column perimeter in mm.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1188" width="463" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The shear stresses should then be checked at successive shear perimeters:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1215" width="124" height="46" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd</e>
          <e type="operand">1000</e>
          <e type="operand">V.eff</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">u</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="162" top="1224" width="234" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>where u is the shear perimeter in mm</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1260" width="534" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Shear reinforcement should consist of vertical links. The total area required is calculated<br />from equations:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1305" width="298" height="302" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math error="2" errorLocation="0">
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ν.Rd1</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd</e>
          <e type="operand">1.6</e>
          <e type="operand">V.Rd1</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">≤</e>
          <e type="operand">A.sw</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.Rd1</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operand">u</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">0.87</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ywk</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          <e type="operand">1.6</e>
          <e type="operand">V.Rd1</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&lt;</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.Sd</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.d1</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">≤</e>
          <e type="operand">A.sw</e>
          <e type="operand">3.83</e>
          <e type="operand">V.sd</e>
          <e type="operand">1.4</e>
          <e type="operand">ν.Rd1</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">u</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">f.ywk</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
          <e type="operand">#</e>
          <e type="function" args="3">if</e>
          <e type="operand">#</e>
          <e type="function" args="3">if</e>
          <e type="function" args="3">if</e>
          <e type="operand">#</e>
          <e type="function" args="3">if</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1629" width="155" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">A.smin</e>
          <e type="operand">0.0015</e>
          <e type="operand">b.t</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="171" top="1629" width="179" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>b.t is the tension zone width</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1656" width="435" height="82" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="1746" width="187" height="48" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">A.s</e>
          <e type="operand">0.6</e>
          <e type="operand">b</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">0.83</e>
          <e type="operand">d</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">x</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="bracket">(</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">σ.s</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="234" top="1755" width="80" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">b</e>
          <e type="operand">500</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">&gt;</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1791" width="386" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>When high-bond bars are used the procedure to be followed is:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1809" width="216" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>(a) arbitrarily select a value for σ.s</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1827" width="247" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>(b) calculate As from the formula above</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1845" width="448" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>(c) obtain the maximum bar spacing corresponding to σ.s from Table 5.14</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1863" width="440" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>(d) obtain the maximum bar diameter corresponding σ.s from Table 5.14</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1881" width="393" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>(e) check that reinforcement can be provided that satisfies either<br />(b) and (c) or<br />(b) and (d)</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1953" width="153" height="74" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">S</e>
          <e type="operand">ϕ.Bar</e>
          <e type="operand">20</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">d.g</e>
          <e type="operand">5</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand">3</e>
          <e type="operand">1</e>
          <e type="function" args="5">mat</e>
          <e type="function" args="1">max</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="2034" width="501" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The design ultimate shear force at the face of the support should not exceed VRd2</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
