        <content>
          <p>Note: For all the above-listed combinations, two possibilities must be considered: either that <br />the surcharge concerns only the part of embankment beyond the foundation footing <br />(Fig. 2.10a), or that it acts on the whole surface of the embankment (Fig. 2.10b). </p>
