    <region left="0" top="14022" width="553" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Considering that the TT element is cast under procedures subjected to a highly efficient <br />quality control, in which the concrete cover length is also assessed, the value of Δcdev can <br />be taken as 5 mm.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
