    </region>
    <region left="0" top="26982" width="124" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Nodes verification </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="27000" width="271" height="98" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The node geometry is unambiguously <br />defined by the column width, the wall <br />depth (250 mm), the height of the side on <br />which the lower bars are distributed and by <br />the strut C3<br /> fall (Fig. 6.7) </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="27099" width="278" height="295" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="27396" width="569" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The node 3 is a compressed-stressed node by a single direction reinforcement anchor, then it <br />is mandatory to verify that the maximal concrete compression is not higher than the value: </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="27432" width="155" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">σ.2Rd.max</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">N</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">12.75</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="27477" width="227" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">σ.c1</e>
          <e type="operand">810000</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">N</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">400</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">250</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">N</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operand">2</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">^</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">8.1</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="27522" width="640" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Remark as the verification of the column contact pressure is satisfied even without taking into account the <br />longitudinal reinforcement (6φ20) present in the column.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="27558" width="267" height="50" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">σ.c2</e>
          <e type="operand">966000</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">N</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">531.6</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">250</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">N</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
