    <region left="0" top="32796" width="256" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>node 2 verification, below the load plate: </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="32814" width="568" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The node 2 is a compressed-stressed node, in which the main reinforcement is anchored; the <br />compressive stress below the load plate is: </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="32850" width="240" height="46" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">σ</e>
          <e type="operand">F.Ed</e>
          <e type="operand">150</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mm</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
