    <region left="0" top="33822" width="222" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Definition of the truss rods position </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="33831" width="558" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>
            <br />The compressed longitudinal bar has a width equal to the depth x of the section neutral axis <br />and then it is x/2 from the top border; the depth of the neutral axis is evaluated from the <br />section translation equilibrium: </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="612" top="33876" width="304" height="278" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="33912" width="231" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math error="68" errorLocation="10">
        <input>
          <e type="operand">0.8</e>
          <e type="operand">b</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">f.cd</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">E.s</e>
          <e type="operand">ε.s'</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operand">A.s'</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">+</e>
          <e type="operand">f.yd</e>
          <e type="operand">A.s</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
