    </region>
    <region left="0" top="34065" width="558" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>then the compressed steel strain results lower than the strain in the elastic limit, as stated in <br />the calculation;</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
