    </region>
    <region left="0" top="34164" width="314" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>(applied at 0.4⋅x ≅ 40 mm from the upper surface) </p>
        </content>
