    <region left="0" top="43200" width="563" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The compressive range for each strut (only exception, the strut C1, which stress has been <br />verified before in the forces evaluation for the region B) can spread between the two ends, in <br />this way the maximal stresses are in the nodes. </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="43254" width="418" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The transversal stress for the split of the most stressed strut (C2) is: </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="423" top="43254" width="97" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
