    <region left="0" top="43308" width="365" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>and then, for the reinforcement required to carry this stress:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
