    </region>
    <region left="0" top="43398" width="546" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>then the minimum reinforcement (1 φ 12 / 20” on both sides and in both directions, that is  <br />as<br /> = 1130 mm2/m) is enough to carry the transversal stresses.</p>
