        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="47655" width="573" height="128" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>As a remark, just in the case c) the concrete tension limit state under load is not reached while <br />in the case a)(k1<br />=0.45) and the other cases b) d) e) f) (k1<br />=0.65) respectively reach the tension <br />ultimate states under load associated to non-linear viscosity phenomena and minimal tension <br />in the presence of particular combinations. On the other hand, the tension ultimate state <br />under load for tied steel is got just in the case b). <br /></p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
  </regions>
</worksheet>